# RENTAL PC2 (registered 2026-11-10, before any page): what v6d cannot yet price, a MEASUREMENT rental.
# GENERATED by scripts/scoring/pc2/register_pc2.py from registration 2026-11-10-pc2-gh200; do not edit by hand.
# vLLM v0.27.1's fused_moe_kernel through the instrumented copy at the ends level (moe/instrumented, unchanged),
# on synthetic routings and SEEN or synthetic expert shapes; Mixtral-8x22B, Qwen2-57B (and its tp8 shard) and
# Granite-3.0-1B are never loaded, by name or by shape (no PC2 GEMM is theirs). Every reading is DESCRIPTIVE
# (no model form, no constant). One gpu_1x_gh200 at $2.29/h, run by PC2's driver (PC's pinned driver plus lines
# marked PC2: probe=pc runs scripts/instr_probe_pc2.py) through PC2's launcher (vm_run.sh plus lines marked PC2):
#   bash scripts/vm_run_pc2.sh start --ip <ip> --run-id <id> --deadline <epoch s> \
#     --plan scripts/plans/rentalPC2-2026-11.plan --driver gh200_pc2_session.sh
# Session lock 1410 MHz (C3's prelude, 700 W read back); every probe unit carries lock-mhz=1710,
# probed by the prelude and read back before and after the tool (pc-locks.env).
# Line order is the priority; the driver drops the LAST unit first: rep, d3, then w. A probe=pc regcheck that
# refuses or crashes, or writes no line for a probe=pc stamps unit, drops every probe=pc unit (PC's rule).
# MINUTES: 35 of units estimated (27 nodrop); wall about 60 min with 25 of boot ($2.29);
# deadline launch + 75 min; guardian hard cap launch + 90 min ($3.44 at most).
- prelude lock-mhz=1410 power-limit-w=700 est=2 cap=15
- tilecensus label=pc2 tiles=16x64x128w4s4,16x64x128w4s3,64x128x64w4s3,32x64x128w4s3,32x128x64w4s3 models=mixtral-8x7b,phi-3.5-moe nodrop=1 est=3 cap=15
- regcheck label=rcp probe=pc nodrop=1 est=3 cap=20
- perturb label=pt probe=pc gates=sd,ss,sn,sw,sd3,sr lock-mhz=1710 nodrop=1 est=8 cap=25
- stamps label=sd probe=pc page=docs/registered/2026-11-10-pc2-pages/pc2-d.json lock-mhz=1710 nodrop=1 est=4 cap=15
- stamps label=ss probe=pc page=docs/registered/2026-11-10-pc2-pages/pc2-s.json lock-mhz=1710 nodrop=1 est=3 cap=12
- stamps label=sn probe=pc page=docs/registered/2026-11-10-pc2-pages/pc2-n.json lock-mhz=1710 nodrop=1 est=4 cap=15
- stamps label=sw probe=pc page=docs/registered/2026-11-10-pc2-pages/pc2-w.json lock-mhz=1710 drop-group=w est=4 cap=15
- stamps label=sd3 probe=pc page=docs/registered/2026-11-10-pc2-pages/pc2-d3.json lock-mhz=1710 drop-group=d3 est=2 cap=8
- stamps label=sr probe=pc page=docs/registered/2026-11-10-pc2-pages/pc2-r.json lock-mhz=1710 drop-group=rep est=2 cap=8
